      "created_at": "2016-09-22T03:14:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As I remember it from playtesting, High Risk Behavior is specifically worded the way it is because if it increased his self-damage, it really wouldn't be worth it most of the time, because he has so much of that.</p>",
